OL,3,GNEWSAMetro plans 'cut off my link from
OL,4,Ahome to work'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA business owner whose shop and home
OL,7,Fare on the same stretch of road fears
OL,8,Fthe two could be permanently separated
OL,9,Fand only accessible by a major
OL,10,Fdiversion if a new railway line cuts
OL,11,Fthrough the area.
OL,13,FLouise King, who works on Railway
OL,14,FTerrace, South Hylton, Sunderland, said
OL,15,Fthe planned Tyne and Wear Metro
OL,16,Fextension to Washington was a
OL,17,F"nightmare" which threatened to cut the
OL,18,Fvillage in two.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
