OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMetro plans 'cut off my link from
OL,4,Ahome to work'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMetro operator Nexus has suggested
OL,7,Fclosing the road to allow the new line
OL,8,Fto continue from the existing station
OL,9,Fterminus, with plans to either re-route
OL,10,Ftraffic via a new road and tunnel, or
OL,11,Fvia Claxheugh Road.
OL,13,FIt said the final plan had not been
OL,14,Fdecided and it would "continue to look
OL,15,Fat alternatives".
